97c1e8ed6547bb22bcca1a33658"},{"id":"617cedc5-575d-4bbc-8c71-4da061aa4837","name":"游淑慧","claim_key":"official-profile:taipei-city-council-current-councilors:40591a70cb6a:18baa376-d8c2-4c5a-803c-ca2a94d13241:platform","person_id":"18baa376-d8c2-4c5a-803c-ca2a94d13241","candidate_id":"ebdc54a3-d692-4671-ba30-63e287d80994","candidate_person_id":"8a3b3fbb-1a4f-477f-9bad-255eb82adee0","canonical_person_id":"147d1faf-c54e-4654-adbb-c02231261f46","candidate_name":"游淑慧","candidate_no":"12","race_id":"8056bfe6-8729-46c7-9200-f2c821d0a728","election_id":"d372c7d4-2ee9-4194-87cd-37d12034bb1b","source_url":"https://www.tcc.gov.tw/Councilor_Content.aspx?n=13898&s=2563","source_sha256":null,"after_source_sha256":null,"after_text":"港湖加游 十大主張\n一、加速老舊地下水管汰換，用水安全。\n二、醫院學校人行道更新預算提高，走的安全。\n三、鄰里公園全面改造，更實用好用，玩的安全。\n四、捷運東環段、民生汐止線全速前進，行的便捷。\n五、增加公託公幼比例，提高私立補助，養的輕鬆。\n六、增加都更專業輔導，合理提高容積獎勵，住的換新。\n七、提案恢復Youbike2.0前30分鐘免費，減輕負擔。\n八、學校改建全面加設停車場，停車供給。\n九、大巨蛋後續強力監督，棒球好場域。\n十、勇敢發聲、專業問政，讓市民聲音不再被忽視，監督有力量。","patch":{"items":["加速老舊地下水管汰換，用水安全。","醫院學校人行道更新預算提高，走的安全。","鄰里公園全面改造，更實用好用，玩的安全。","捷運東環段、民生汐止線全速前進，行的便捷。","增加公託公幼比例，提高私立補助，養的輕鬆。","增加都更專業輔導，合理提高容積獎勵，住的換新。","提案恢復Youbike2.0前30分鐘免費，減輕負擔。","學校改建全面加設停車場，停車供給。","大巨蛋後續強力監督，棒球好場域。","勇敢發聲、專業問政，讓市民聲音不再被忽視，監督有力量。"],"platformIntro":"","contentSplit":{"method":"source_checked_review_directed_repair_20260930","version":"election-content-items-v1","confidence":98,"reviewStatus":"auto_approved","releaseQuality":{"version":"platform-fulfillment-release-v1","reasonCodes":["heading_or_slogan"],"excludedItemCount":3}},"platformReviewRepair":{"version":"2022-platform-review-20260930","reviewDocumentSha256":"2c05197f93e3753024b9201720687372f47be16dbbb421a301b1ef274575dfc0","reviewNumber":43,"changes":["2022 CEC PDF第2頁游淑慧12號本人欄確認，補回原第3、第4項"],"remainingIssues":[],"previousContentSplit":{"method":"numbered","version":"election-content-items-v1","confidence":98,"reviewStatus":"auto_approved","releaseQuality":{"version":"platform-fulfillment-release-v1","reasonCodes":["headin